  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "While Savage Wilderness forces press Yellow Earth Gu Immortals in the sky, a snow wing eagle pecks a Yellow Earth Gu Immortal and devours that immortal whole. Voices cry Xue Li Du’s name. Snow wing eagle Xue Li Du says in a shrill voice that escape is not an option, and Yellow Earth aerial morale collapses.",
      "chapters": [
        2156
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Xiao He Jian and other Fang Yuan subordinates reach Hei Liu Biao and Xue Li Du. Yellow Earth survivors warn that the two are powerful rank eight experts from Savage Wilderness Great World. Xue Li Du smiles coldly and charges into the Gu Immortal group, saying numbers do not determine everything. It is killed even earlier than Hei Liu Biao, and its corpse is completely split up between the Gu Immortals.",
      "chapters": [
        2158
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_xiao_he_jian",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_hei_liu_biao",
        "loc_savage_wilderness_great_world"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bing Sai Chuan later reads that Hei Liu Biao and Xue Li Du, powerful rank eight experts in Savage Wilderness Great World, died so easily to Fang Yuan’s force.",
